<title>SINGAPORE: Clipsal first half up 16.4 percent.</title>
<headline>Clipsal first half up 16.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  10.63   vs   9.13</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	    11.70   vs  10.10</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)		  3.80   vs   3.25</p>
<p>    Turnover			    80.23   vs  69.50</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  14.57   vs  11.47</p>
<p>    Interest expense		   1.67   vs   1.43</p>
<p>    Associates			   3.58   vs   3.75</p>
<p>    Pretax				13.33   vs  11.24</p>
<p>    Tax				    2.57   vs   2.09</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		   11.20   vs   1.44</p>
<p>Div pay/register - November 1 / October 18 1996.</p>
<p>Note- Clipsal Industries Holdings Ltd said the extraordinary gain includes profit from the sale of the group's interest in an associate company. - Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
